mainuan-welcome (2.2.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Each accent color applies its Mainuan wallpaper; visual styles keep it.
  * Six native Plasma 6 desktop layouts with backup, automatic rollback and
    "Restaurar layout anterior".
  * Sobre with a local system report (copy/save, no private data).
  * Contribuir with an offline Pix QR code; ships /etc/mainuan/welcome.conf.
  * Line icons in the sidebar and one page width across the app.
  * Plasma version read over D-Bus instead of running plasmashell, which
    crashed when started by the tests during package builds.

 -- ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 17:40:00 -0300

mainuan-welcome (2.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Native Qt 6/Kirigami Welcome with the universal installer.
  * Official Mainuan logo, per-user "show at login" preference and
    system-wide XDG autostart entry.

